    "text": "<p>Match List-<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></math> with List-<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>II</mi></math>.</p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 500px;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">List-<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></math></td>\t\t\t<td colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">List-<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>II</mi></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(a)</td>\t\t\t<td><img src=\"assets\\qt0092_330f4f5ab514.png\" style=\"width: 312px; height: 79px;\" /></td>\t\t\t<td>(i)</td>\t\t\t<td>Wurtz reaction</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(b)</td>\t\t\t<td><img src=\"assets\\qt0092_da57d769c59b.png\" style=\"width: 312px; height: 79px;\" /></td>\t\t\t<td>(ii)</td>\t\t\t<td>Sandmeyer reaction</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(c)</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>Cl</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>Na</mi><mover><mo>&#10230;</mo><mi>Ether</mi></mover><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>5</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>5</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>NaCl</mi></math></td>\t\t\t<td>(iii)</td>\t\t\t<td>Fittig reaction</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(d)</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>6</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>5</mn></msub><mi>Cl</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>Na</mi><mover><mo>&#10230;</mo><mi>Ether</mi></mover><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>6</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>5</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>6</mn></msub>